Action hooks for NVlabs/catk (commit d238867), src/smart/modules/agent_decoder.py.
Moves the next-action sampling and the chosen-action embedding of SMARTAgentDecoder.inference()
into two overridable methods, sample_next_action() and embed_next_action(). Behaviour of the
token head is unchanged. The continuous heads in src/tokens_vs_flows override these methods.
